        "original_id": "2dde4299-149d-5b3e-aa67-09f0bc0f0179",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terri Nunn, Sonya Scarlet, Virginia Macolino\n- Organizations: Berlin, Theatres des Vampires\n- Products: Information (Berlin album)\n- Roles: singer, actress, lyricist, lead vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Terri Nunn was born on June 26, 1961, and she is an American singer and actress.\n- Sonya Scarlet was born on April 2, 1980, and she is the singer and lyricist of the Italian extreme gothic metal band Theatres des Vampires.\n- During the recording of the album Information by Berlin, Terri Nunn had temporarily left the band to pursue an acting career.\n- During that recording period for Information, Virginia Macolino performed the lead vocals for Berlin.",
